subsection.subsection:
A taxpayer may claim a refundable credit under this section if:
the taxpayer owns a hydrogen production system;
the hydrogen production system is completed and placed in service on or after January 1, 2022;
the taxpayer sells as a commercial enterprise, or supplies for the taxpayer's own use in commercial units, the hydrogen produced from the hydrogen production system;
the taxpayer has not claimed and will not claim a tax credit under Section 59-7-614 for electricity used to meet the requirements of this section; and
the taxpayer obtains a written certification from the office in accordance with Subsection (3).
